Frame eye forwarding — licensing

This repository is two things, under two licenses. They are not interchangeable.

  1. THIS WRAPPER (setup scripts, README, patches, desktop/Steam helpers,
     and any other files in this folder except third-party code) is
     Copyright (c) 2026 Merkel_User and is licensed under the PolyForm
     Noncommercial License 1.0.0. You may use and modify it for
     non-commercial purposes if you keep the notices below. Commercial
     use of this wrapper requires permission from Merkel_User.

     Required Notice: Copyright (c) 2026 Merkel_User — Frame eye forwarding
     (PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0). Credit the author when you share
     or modify this wrapper.

  2. FRAMEEYEOSC (https://github.com/konsti219/frameeyeosc) is a separate
     program by konsti219. It is licensed under the MIT License
     (Copyright (c) 2026 konsti219). This wrapper only clones, builds,
     and lightly patches that program. Nothing in this file takes away
     MIT rights in frameeyeosc. You must keep konsti219's copyright and
     MIT notice whenever you copy that software.

Credit both: Merkel_User for this installer/calibration wrapper, and konsti219
for the eye-tracking / OSC implementation.

